WEBVTT

00:00:58.556 --> 00:01:00.436
if they need to teach their young

00:01:00.436 --> 00:01:02.276
how to shine

00:01:02.796 --> 00:01:06.116
I wonder if shadows long

00:01:06.116 --> 00:01:09.516
to just-for-once feel the sun

00:01:09.876 --> 00:01:11.756
if they get lost in the shuffle

00:01:11.756 --> 00:01:13.636
not knowing where they’re from

00:01:13.956 --> 00:01:16.796
I wonder if sunrise

00:01:16.796 --> 00:01:18.556
and sunset

00:01:18.556 --> 00:01:20.156
respect each other

00:01:20.356 --> 00:01:22.316
even though they’ve never met

00:01:22.676 --> 00:01:24.476
if storms have regrets

00:01:24.596 --> 00:01:27.036
if volcanoes get stressed

00:01:27.076 --> 00:01:31.516
if compost believes in life